<sp who="#FHENSCHEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Frau Hen&#x017F;chel.</hi></speaker> <p>Ei Siebenh<hi rendition="#aq">a</hi>rn bi&#x017F;t Du doch reene<lb/>
