<sp who="#FHENSCHEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Frau Hen&#x017F;chel.</hi></speaker> <p>Nu &#x017F;ieh, d<hi rendition="#aq">a</hi>ß Du furt kimm&#x017F;t, &#x017F;u&#x017F;te<lb/>
