<sp who="#FHENSCHEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Frau Hen&#x017F;chel.</hi></speaker> <p>Die hot a ir&#x017F;cht g<hi rendition="#aq">a</hi>r ni meh ei dr<lb/>
