<sp who="#FHENSCHEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Frau Hen&#x017F;chel.</hi></speaker> <p>W<hi rendition="#aq">a</hi>s war denn lus?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#GEO"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">George.</hi></speaker> <p>Enne Feuerwehr-Sitzung. Se ham doch &#x2019;ne<lb/>
