<sp who="#FAB"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Fabig.</hi></speaker> <p>Und uf de Schenk&#x017F;tube &#x017F;pitzt &#x017F;e &#x017F;chun lange!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#SIE"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Siebenhaar</hi></speaker> <stage>zu Hauffe.</stage> <p>Hauffe, man &#x017F;ieht Sie ja gar<lb/>
