<sp who="#FAB"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Fabig.</hi></speaker> <p>Sei Weib hot ebens die Ho&#x017F;a <hi rendition="#aq">a</hi>.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HAU"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Hauffe.</hi></speaker> <p>Ich bin er ni meh geferre genung. Dr<lb/>
