<sp who="#SIE"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Siebenhaar.</hi></speaker> <p>Der alte Hen&#x017F;chel kann einem leid thun!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HAU"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Hauffe.</hi></speaker> <p>Is a&#x2019;s zufriede, w<hi rendition="#aq">a</hi>s gieht&#x2019;s mich <hi rendition="#aq">a</hi>! <hi rendition="#aq">A</hi>der<lb/>
