<sp who="#HAU"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Hauffe.</hi></speaker> <p>Nu w<hi rendition="#aq">a</hi>s denn &#x017F;u&#x017F;te! &#x2019;s is au ni ander&#x017F;ch.<lb/>
